---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { contact, legalLinks } from '../config/site';
---

<Base title="Refund policy" description="Refund and cancellation policy for Grow Your Wealth Bootcamp event tickets." path="/refund-policy">
  <PageIntro label="Refunds & cancellations" title="Refund <em>policy.</em>" lede="The short version: event tickets are non-refundable, and ticket holders get replay access instead." />

  <div class="wrap legal">
    <aside class="legal__meta" aria-label="Policy details">
      <span>Applies to: event tickets</span>
      <span>Last updated: November 22, 2023</span>
      <span>Issued by: Noelle Randall Inc.</span>
    </aside>

    <article class="legal__body">
      <h2>Refunds &amp; cancellations</h2>
      <p>
        By continuing with your purchase and entering your credit card information, or otherwise enrolling,
        electronically, verbally, or otherwise, in acquiring event tickets, you (“Client”) are agreeing to the following
        refund policy.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not offer refunds on event tickets. All agreements for event tickets are NOT subject to cancellation or
        refund but may be eligible for store credit or transfer to a future event. We do not accept any verbal
        modifications of these Agreements and the “no refund and no cancellation” policy stated in the Agreements is
        strictly adhered to. This policy is reiterated in the Terms &amp; Conditions that you are required to agree to by
        clicking the checkbox during the checkout process in order to complete your transaction.
      </p>
      <p>
        Be sure to return to this Policy periodically to review the most current version of the Policy. We reserve the
        right at any time, at our sole discretion, to change or otherwise modify this Policy without prior notice;
        however, the date of any effective changes shall be reflected on this page and upon request we will provide you
        with information regarding any changes made.
      </p>

      <h2>If you can’t attend</h2>
      <p>
        Ticket holders are given access to the replay after the event (three weeks after the most recent edition), so
        missing the live day doesn’t mean missing the content.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Contact the support team at <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> or
        <a href={contact.phoneHref}>{contact.phoneDisplay}</a>. The full
        <a href={legalLinks.terms} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> of Noelle Randall Inc. also
        apply.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
